{
  "version": "1.0",
  "name": "文件操作-写入文件",
  "description": "演示写入文件：把变量写成 txt/csv/xlsx/json。运行前无需准备；本例先把当前时间存成变量再写成文本文件。输出在 output/txt/ 下，Windows/macOS 通用（相对路径）。",
  "hotkey_run": "f9",
  "hotkey_stop": "f12",
  "start_delay": 2.0,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type_id": "util.log",
      "params": {
        "message": "本示例演示「写入文件」：先取当前时间存为变量 now_time，再把它写成文本文件。",
        "level": "信息",
        "on_error": "停止流程",
        "retry": 3,
        "retry_interval": 1.0,
        "timeout": 0.0
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "note": "",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "type_id": "util.current_time",
      "params": {
        "fmt": "日期时间（2026-09-26 17:31:50）",
        "save_var": "now_time",
        "on_error": "停止流程",
        "retry": 3,
        "retry_interval": 1.0,
        "timeout": 0.0
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "note": "这一步只是准备演示数据；换场景时写入变量可改成你的 rows、info 等任意变量",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "type_id": "util.write_file",
      "params": {
        "path": "output/txt/运行记录.txt",
        "format": "txt",
        "input_var": "now_time",
        "start_cell": "A1",
        "list_direction": "横向",
        "input_selector": "",
        "input_vtype": "自动",
        "on_error": "停止流程",
        "retry": 3,
        "retry_interval": 1.0,
        "timeout": 0.0
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "note": "写入变量改成你要输出的变量；格式选 xlsx 可存表格/列表（配合起始单元格与填充方向），json 仅支持字典",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "type_id": "util.log",
      "params": {
        "level": "成功",
        "message": "完成，已写入 output/txt/运行记录.txt。改成你的变量与路径即可，不存在的目录会自动创建。",
        "on_error": "停止流程",
        "retry": 3,
        "retry_interval": 1.0,
        "timeout": 0.0
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "note": "",
      "children": []
    }
  ]
}